"""
VideoPreview — 视频播放预览控件
基于 QMediaPlayer + QVideoWidget，支持播放/暂停/快进/seek
【开发状态：已完成】
"""

import os
from PyQt6.QtWidgets import (
    QWidget, QVBoxLayout, QHBoxLayout, QLabel,
    QPushButton, QSlider,
)
from PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, QUrl, QTimer
from PyQt6.QtMultimedia import QMediaPlayer, QAudioOutput
from PyQt6.QtMultimediaWidgets import QVideoWidget

from app.theme import COLORS
from app.utils.file_utils import format_duration


class VideoPreview(QWidget):
    """视频播放器"""

    def __init__(self, parent=None):
        super().__init__(parent)
        self._filepath = ""
        self._duration = 0.0
        self._seeking = False
        self._init_ui()
        self._init_player()

    def _init_ui(self):
        layout = QVBoxLayout(self)
        layout.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)
        layout.setSpacing(6)

        # 视频画面
        self._video_widget = QVideoWidget()
        self._video_widget.setMinimumHeight(300)
        self._video_widget.setStyleSheet("background-color: #000; border-radius: 8px;")
        layout.addWidget(self._video_widget, 1)

        # 控制栏
        ctrl = QHBoxLayout()
        ctrl.setSpacing(10)

        # 播放/暂停
        self._play_btn = QPushButton("▶")
        self._play_btn.setFixedSize(40, 40)
        self._play_btn.setCursor(Qt.CursorShape.PointingHandCursor)
        self._play_btn.clicked.connect(self._toggle_play)
        self._play_btn.setStyleSheet(f"""
            QPushButton {{
                background-color: {COLORS['accent']}; color: #fff;
                border-radius: 20px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;
            }}
            QPushButton:hover {{ background-color: {COLORS['accent_hover']}; }}
        """)
        ctrl.addWidget(self._play_btn)

        # 时间显示
        self._time_label = QLabel("00:00 / 00:00")
        self._time_label.setStyleSheet(f"color: {COLORS['text_secondary']}; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; min-width: 120px;")
        ctrl.addWidget(self._time_label)

        # 播放进度条
        self._seek = QSlider(Qt.Orientation.Horizontal)
        self._seek.setRange(0, 10000)
        self._seek.sliderPressed.connect(self._on_seek_press)
        self._seek.sliderReleased.connect(self._on_seek_release)
        self._seek.sliderMoved.connect(self._on_seek_move)
        ctrl.addWidget(self._seek, 1)

        layout.addLayout(ctrl)

        # 刷新定时器
        self._refresh_timer = QTimer(self)
        self._refresh_timer.timeout.connect(self._update_position)
        self._refresh_timer.start(200)

    def _init_player(self):
        self._player = QMediaPlayer()
        self._audio = QAudioOutput()
        self._player.setAudioOutput(self._audio)
        self._player.setVideoOutput(self._video_widget)
        self._player.errorOccurred.connect(self._on_error)

    # ---- 公开方法 ----
    def load_video(self, filepath: str):
        """加载视频文件"""
        self._filepath = filepath
        if not os.path.exists(filepath):
            return
        url = QUrl.fromLocalFile(os.path.abspath(filepath))
        self._player.setSource(url)
        self._player.mediaStatusChanged.connect(self._on_media_loaded)
        # 给一个初始位置触发加载
        self._player.play()
        self._player.pause()

    def set_position(self, sec: float):
        """跳转到指定秒数"""
        self._player.setPosition(int(sec * 1000))

    def get_position(self) -> float:
        return self._player.position() / 1000.0 if self._player.duration() > 0 else 0.0

    def get_duration(self) -> float:
        return self._duration

    # ---- 内部 ----
    def _on_media_loaded(self, status):
        if status == QMediaPlayer.MediaStatus.LoadedMedia:
            self._duration = self._player.duration() / 1000.0

    def _toggle_play(self):
        if self._player.playbackState() == QMediaPlayer.PlaybackState.PlayingState:
            self._player.pause()
            self._play_btn.setText("▶")
        else:
            if self._player.mediaStatus() == QMediaPlayer.MediaStatus.EndOfMedia:
                self._player.setPosition(0)
            self._player.play()
            self._play_btn.setText("⏸")

    def _update_position(self):
        if self._player.playbackState() == QMediaPlayer.PlaybackState.StoppedState:
            return
        dur = self._player.duration()
        if dur <= 0:
            return
        pos = self._player.position()
        self._duration = dur / 1000.0

        if not self._seeking:
            self._seek.blockSignals(True)
            self._seek.setValue(int(pos / dur * 10000))
            self._seek.blockSignals(False)

        self._time_label.setText(
            f"{format_duration(pos/1000)} / {format_duration(dur/1000)}"
        )

    def _on_seek_press(self):
        self._seeking = True

    def _on_seek_release(self):
        self._seeking = False
        val = self._seek.value()
        self._player.setPosition(int(val / 10000.0 * self._player.duration()))

    def _on_seek_move(self, val: int):
        # 实时更新显示
        dur = self._player.duration()
        if dur > 0:
            self._time_label.setText(
                f"{format_duration(val/10000*dur/1000)} / {format_duration(dur/1000)}"
            )

    def _on_error(self, error, error_string):
        # QMediaPlayer 播放某些格式可能失败，静默处理
        pass

    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
    def resizeEvent(self, event):
        super().resizeEvent(event)
